Naloxone and test-strip stations outside Detroit:
  Wayne County Healthy Communities, "Well Wayne Stations" location map
    (endoverdosewayne.org). The map states no terms of use; we publish the
    County's own facts, name the County on every row, and carry the map's own
    "Map updated" date. Asking the County about reuse is still owed. The
    content is the County's; the delivery is Google's — the map is a published
    Google My Map and we read its own KML endpoint
    (google.com/maps/d/kml?mid=...&forcekml=1), which Google documents nowhere.
    Asking the County for the file directly is owed too.

